<div id="A3.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Taking Qwen2.5VL-72B as an example, we observe that although the <span id="A3.SS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Living Room</span> contains more objects than the <span id="A3.SS2.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Kitchen</span>, model performance is similar. Likewise, the <span id="A3.SS2.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Medical Area</span> has a comparable number of objects to the <span id="A3.SS2.p2.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Kitchen</span>, yet achieves significantly higher accuracy.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T12" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 12: </span>Scene complexity and Qwen2.5VL-72B performance by activity.</figcaption>
